[
{
	message: <<EOM
An example configuration file for rtorrent has been installed in
%%ETCDIR%%. Read it for more information on
how to tweak rtorrent configuration.
EOM
	type: install
}
{
	message: <<EOM
rtorrent 0.16 renamed several configuration commands. A configuration
file written for an earlier version may fail at startup with an error
such as:

  Error in option file: ~/.config/rtorrent/rtorrent.rc:29:
  Command "network.port_range.set" does not exist.

For example:

  network.port_range.set   -> network.listen.port.range.set
  network.port_random.set  -> network.listen.port.random.set

Compare your configuration against the updated example in
%%ETCDIR%%/rtorrent.conf.sample and adjust any commands
that rtorrent reports as missing.

See also https://github.com/rakshasa/rtorrent/issues/1935
EOM
	type: upgrade
	maximum_version: "0.16.20"
}
]
